  "title": "Slow Cooker Lamb Chops",
  "description": "Tender crockpot lamb chops, perfectly seasoned with Dijon mustard, honey, and herbs. The lamb is slow cooked in red wine for a delicious dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "walliser"
  ],
